A ragged table keeps each row's cell count

```
| ~x~ |
| a | b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><s>x</s></td></tr>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| |x |
|---|
| y |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">x</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>y</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| h |
|---|
| |x |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">h</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td><td>x</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
